msgid ""
"{{ inviter_name }} gave you the %(role)s role at {{ org_name }}. Sign in to "
"get started."
msgstr ""
"{{ inviter_name }} назначил(а) вам роль «%(role)s» в {{ org_name }}. "
"Войдите, чтобы начать."

msgid "You got this email because you were given a role at {{ org_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что вам назначили роль в {{ org_name }}."

#. Translators: %(workspace)s is the new organisation's name in bold.
msgid ""
"Thanks for signing up for the AI Course Creator free trial on {{ "
"platform_name }}. Your workspace, %(workspace)s, is set up and your account "
"is active. Sign in to start building courses with AI."
msgstr ""
"Спасибо за регистрацию в бесплатной пробной версии AI Course Creator на {{ "
"platform_name }}. Ваше рабочее пространство %(workspace)s настроено, аккаунт"
" активен. Войдите, чтобы начать создавать курсы с помощью AI."

#. Translators: %(address)s is the organisation's reply-to email address, as a
#. link.
msgid "Questions? Write to %(address)s."
msgstr "Есть вопросы? Напишите на %(address)s."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you signed up for a free trial with {{ "
"email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что зарегистрировались в бесплатной пробной "
"версии с адресом {{ email_address }}."

msgid ""
"The password for your {{ platform_name }} account ({{ email_address }}) was "
"changed on {{ changed_at }}."
msgstr ""
"Пароль вашего аккаунта {{ platform_name }} ({{ email_address }}) был изменён"
" {{ changed_at }}."

#. Translators: %(not_you)s is "Wasn't you?" in bold; %(address)s is the
#. reply-to email address, as a link.
msgid ""
"%(not_you)s Reset your password now from the sign-in page and contact "
"%(address)s."
msgstr ""
"%(not_you)s Сбросьте пароль на странице входа и свяжитесь с %(address)s."

msgid "Wasn't you?"
msgstr "Это были не вы?"

msgid ""
"You got this email because the password of your account changed. It can't be"
" switched off."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что пароль вашего аккаунта изменён. Его "
"нельзя отключить."

msgid "{{ raised_by }} raised a ticket."
msgstr "{{ raised_by }} создал(а) обращение."

msgid "Type"
msgstr "Тип"

msgid ""
"You got this email because you get support ticket alerts at {{ org_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что получаете оповещения об обращениях в "
"поддержку в {{ org_name }}."

msgid "Claim your place at {{ org_name }}"
msgstr "Получите место в {{ org_name }}"

msgid "Your place is waiting:"
msgstr "Ваше место ждёт вас:"

#. Translators: %(address)s is the buyer's email address in bold.
msgid ""
"Sign in or create an account with %(address)s, then claim your place: it is "
"for this address."
msgstr ""
"Войдите или создайте аккаунт с адресом %(address)s, затем получите место: "
"оно предназначено для этого адреса."

msgid ""
"This link works until {{ expires_on }}. If you didn't ask for this, ignore "
"this email."
msgstr ""
"Ссылка действует до {{ expires_on }}. Если вы этого не запрашивали, "
"проигнорируйте это письмо."

msgid ""
"You got this email because a place at {{ org_name }} was requested for {{ "
"email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что для {{ email_address }} было запрошено "
"место в {{ org_name }}."

msgid "Thanks for your purchase"
msgstr "Спасибо за покупку"

msgid "Hi {{ first_name }},"
msgstr "Здравствуйте, {{ first_name }}!"

msgid ""
"Your payment to {{ org_name }} went through. Here is your receipt for order "
"{{ order_number }}, paid on {{ order_date }}."
msgstr ""
"Ваш платёж в {{ org_name }} прошёл. Вот чек по заказу {{ order_number }}, "
"оплаченному {{ order_date }}."

msgid "Paid by {{ payment_method }}. You can start learning now."
msgstr ""
"Оплачено: {{ payment_method }}. Вы можете начать обучение прямо сейчас."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you bought {{ items }} on {{ platform_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что приобрели {{ items }} на {{ platform_name"
" }}."

#. Translators: {{ reason }} is the payment provider's sentence; %(amount)s is
#. the currency and amount in
#. bold; %(plan)s is the plan's name in bold.
msgid ""
"{{ reason }} We tried to take %(amount)s for %(plan)s and the payment didn't"
" go through, so your access has ended."
msgstr ""
"{{ reason }} Мы попытались списать %(amount)s за %(plan)s, но платёж не "
"прошёл, поэтому ваш доступ прекращён."

msgid "Update your payment method to subscribe again."
msgstr "Обновите способ оплаты, чтобы снова оформить подписку."

msgid ""
"You got this email because you subscribe to {{ plan_name }} with {{ "
"email_address }}. It can't be switched off."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что подписаны на {{ plan_name }} с адресом {{"
" email_address }}. Его нельзя отключить."

#. Translators: %(name)s is the course's name in bold.
msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} enrolled you in %(name)s on {{ platform_name }}. Complete "
"your registration to open it."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} записала вас на %(name)s на {{ platform_name }}. Завершите "
"регистрацию, чтобы открыть его."

#. Translators: %(address)s is the enrolled email address in bold.
msgid "Register with %(address)s: the place is for this address."
msgstr ""
"Зарегистрируйтесь с адресом %(address)s: место предназначено для этого "
"адреса."

msgid ""
"You got this email because {{ org_name }} enrolled {{ email_address }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что {{ org_name }} записала {{ email_address "
"}}."

msgid "You got this email because {{ org_name }} sent it to you."
msgstr "Вы получили это письмо, потому что {{ org_name }} отправила его вам."

msgid "Mobile app crash reported"
msgstr "Получен отчёт о сбое мобильного приложения"

msgid "The {{ platform_name }} mobile app reported a crash."
msgstr "Мобильное приложение {{ platform_name }} сообщило о сбое."

msgid ""
"You got this email because it is the crash report address of {{ "
"platform_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что этот адрес указан для отчётов о сбоях {{ "
"platform_name }}."

msgid ""
"Your order for {{ order_summary }} is confirmed, and {{ tenant_name }} now "
"has an account at {{ org_name }}. Set up your sign-in to manage it."
msgstr ""
"Ваш заказ ({{ order_summary }}) подтверждён, и у {{ tenant_name }} теперь "
"есть аккаунт в {{ org_name }}. Настройте вход, чтобы управлять им."

msgid ""
"Once {{ org_name }} activates the account, you can invite your people, book "
"their sessions and follow their progress."
msgstr ""
"Когда {{ org_name }} активирует аккаунт, вы сможете приглашать своих "
"сотрудников, бронировать для них занятия и следить за их прогрессом."

msgid "This link works until {{ expires_on }}."
msgstr "Ссылка действует до {{ expires_on }}."

msgid "You got this email because you bought seats for {{ tenant_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что приобрели места для {{ tenant_name }}."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} recorded {{ tenant_possessive }} order for {{ order_summary "
"}}. We'll email the invoice to you."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} зарегистрировала заказ {{ tenant_possessive }}: {{ "
"order_summary }}. Мы отправим вам счёт по электронной почте."

msgid ""
"Set up your sign-in to manage the seats. Once {{ org_name }} activates the "
"account, you can invite your people and book their sessions."
msgstr ""
"Настройте вход, чтобы управлять местами. Когда {{ org_name }} активирует "
"аккаунт, вы сможете приглашать своих сотрудников и бронировать для них "
"занятия."

msgid ""
"You got this email because {{ org_name }} recorded an order for {{ "
"tenant_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что {{ org_name }} зарегистрировала заказ для"
" {{ tenant_name }}."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid ""
"{{ inviter_name }} invited you to manage {{ tenant_possessive }} account at "
"{{ org_name }} with them. Set up your sign-in to invite people, book their "
"sessions and follow their progress."
msgstr ""
"{{ inviter_name }} приглашает вас вместе управлять аккаунтом {{ "
"tenant_possessive }} в {{ org_name }}. Настройте вход, чтобы приглашать "
"людей, бронировать для них занятия и следить за их прогрессом."

msgid ""
"You got this email because {{ inviter_name }} invited you to manage {{ "
"tenant_name }}."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо, потому что {{ inviter_name }} пригласил(а) вас "
"управлять {{ tenant_name }}."

msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} activated your account. You can have up to {{ learner_limit "
"}} people learning at once."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} активировала ваш аккаунт. Одновременно могут учиться до {{ "
"learner_limit }} человек."

#. Translators: {{ seats_summary }} is a whole sentence, such as "Your 20
#. seats in Fire safety are ready
#. to give out."
msgid "{{ seats_summary }} Invite your people, then book their sessions."
msgstr ""
"{{ seats_summary }} Пригласите своих сотрудников, затем забронируйте для них"
" занятия."

msgid "You got this email because you manage {{ tenant_name }}."
msgstr "Вы получили это письмо, потому что управляете {{ tenant_name }}."

#. Translators: {{ tenant_possessive }} is the company's name, possessive
#. ("Bolt Freight's"). You may
#. write {{ tenant_name }} instead, the name alone ("Bolt Freight"), where
#. your language puts it another way.
msgid ""
"{{ org_name }} renewed {{ tenant_possessive }} contract until {{ "
"renewed_until }} with a learner limit of {{ learner_limit }}. You have {{ "
"active_learners }} people."
msgstr ""
"{{ org_name }} продлила договор {{ tenant_possessive }} до {{ renewed_until "
"}} с лимитом слушателей {{ learner_limit }}. У вас сейчас {{ active_learners"
" }} чел."

msgid ""
"Choose the {{ learner_limit }} who keep access before {{ choose_by }}. Until"
" you choose, everyone stays as they are now."
msgstr ""
"Выберите слушателей ({{ learner_limit }}), которые сохранят доступ, до {{ "
"choose_by }}. Пока вы не сделаете выбор, всё останется как сейчас."

msgid "your program"
msgstr "ваша программа"

msgid "Your enrollment in %(title)s was updated"
msgstr "Ваша запись на «%(title)s» обновлена"

msgid "You're enrolled in %(title)s"
msgstr "Вы записаны на «%(title)s»"

msgid "Your access to %(title)s changed. Open the course to see what's new."
msgstr ""
"Ваш доступ к «%(title)s» изменился. Откройте курс, чтобы узнать, что нового."

msgid "You have a place in %(title)s. Open it from My learning."
msgstr ""
"У вас есть место на «%(title)s». Откройте его в разделе «Моё обучение»."

msgid "Go to my program"
msgstr "Перейти к программе"

msgid "You've earned your %(title)s certificate"
msgstr "Вы получили сертификат «%(title)s»"

msgid "Congratulations! You passed %(title)s and earned its certificate."
msgstr "Поздравляем! Вы успешно прошли «%(title)s» и получили сертификат."

msgid "You got this email because of your notification settings."
msgstr ""
"Вы получили это письмо в соответствии с вашими настройками уведомлений."

msgid "A learner"
msgstr "Слушатель"

msgid "%(who)s completed %(title)s on a seat from %(tenant)s."
msgstr "%(who)s завершил(а) «%(title)s» на месте от %(tenant)s."

msgid "%(who)s passed %(title)s on a seat from %(tenant)s."
msgstr "%(who)s успешно прошёл(а) «%(title)s» на месте от %(tenant)s."

#. Translators: %(who)s is a learner's name; %(title)s a course or program.
msgid "%(who)s finished %(title)s"
msgstr "%(who)s завершил(а) «%(title)s»"

msgid "%(email)s hasn't accepted your invitation"
msgstr "%(email)s ещё не принял(а) ваше приглашение"

#. Translators: %(day)s is the date the invitation was sent.
msgid ""
"You invited %(email)s to learn with %(tenant)s on %(day)s, and they haven't "
"accepted yet. You can send the invitation again from People."
msgstr ""
"%(day)s вы пригласили %(email)s учиться в %(tenant)s, но приглашение ещё не "
"принято. Вы можете отправить его повторно в разделе «Люди»."

msgid "a course"
msgstr "курс"

#. Translators: %(seats)s is a number of seats ("3 seats"); %(where)s what
#. they are for.
msgid "%(seats)s in %(where)s not given out yet"
msgstr "%(seats)s в %(where)s ещё не распределены"

msgid ""
"%(tenant)s still has %(seats)s to give out in %(where)s. Enrollment closes "
"on %(day)s; seats not given by then can't be used."
msgstr ""
"У %(tenant)s ещё есть нераспределённые места (%(seats)s) в %(where)s. Запись"
" закрывается %(day)s; места, не распределённые к этому сроку, использовать "
"будет нельзя."

msgid "Order %(number)s is paid"
msgstr "Заказ %(number)s оплачен"

#. Translators: %(total)s is money with its currency; %(tenant)s a company.
msgid ""
"We received %(total)s for %(tenant)s's order %(number)s. Its seats are ready"
" to give out."
msgstr ""
"Мы получили %(total)s по заказу %(number)s компании %(tenant)s. Места готовы"
" к распределению."

msgid "%(tenant)s is ready"
msgstr "%(tenant)s: всё готово"

#. Translators: %(limit)s is a number of people.
msgid ""
"Your account is active. You can have up to %(limit)s people learning at "
"once."
msgstr "Ваш аккаунт активен. Одновременно могут учиться до %(limit)s человек."

#. Translators: %(tenant)s is a company's name; %(limit)s is a number of
#. people.
msgid ""
"%(tenant)s's contract was renewed with a learner limit of %(limit)s. Choose "
"who keeps access."
msgstr ""
"Договор с %(tenant)s продлён с лимитом слушателей %(limit)s. Выберите, кто "
"сохранит доступ."

#. Translators: %(seats)s lists the seats, such as "20 seats in Fire safety
#. and 5 seats in First aid".
msgid "Your %(seats)s is ready to give out."
msgid_plural "Your %(seats)s are ready to give out."
msgstr[0] "Ваши места готовы к распределению (%(seats)s)."
msgstr[1] "Ваши места готовы к распределению (%(seats)s)."
msgstr[2] "Ваши места готовы к распределению (%(seats)s)."

msgid "Grades"
msgstr "Оценки"

msgid "Enrollments"
msgstr "Записи"

msgid "Certificates"
msgstr "Сертификаты"

msgid "Session attendance"
msgstr "Посещаемость занятия"

msgid "Learner progress"
msgstr "Прогресс слушателя"

msgid "Every answer"
msgstr "Каждый ответ"

msgid "Submissions"
msgstr "Отправленные работы"

msgid "Anonymous IDs"
msgstr "Анонимные идентификаторы"

msgid "Video views"
msgstr "Просмотры видео"

msgid "Assessment scores"
msgstr "Результаты оценивания"

msgid "Invited, not enrolled"
msgstr "Приглашён, не записан"

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name.
msgid "Your {report} report is ready"
msgstr "Ваш отчёт «{report}» готов"

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name.
msgid "The {report} report for this course is ready to download."
msgstr "Отчёт «{report}» по этому курсу готов к скачиванию."

msgid "Download the report"
msgstr "Скачать отчёт"

msgid "Your data is ready to download"
msgstr "Ваши данные готовы к скачиванию"

#. Translators: {days} is how many days the download link works.
msgid ""
"Your data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The link "
"works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Ваши данные готовы: один zip-файл со всем, что хранит Blend-ed. Ссылка "
"действует {days} дн. и только для вас."

#. Translators: the title when the person whose data was exported no longer
#. has an account.
msgid "this person's data is ready to download"
msgstr "Данные этого пользователя готовы к скачиванию"

#. Translators: the message when the person whose data was exported no longer
#. has an account; {days} is
#. how many days the link works.
msgid ""
"this person's data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The "
"link works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Данные этого пользователя готовы: один zip-файл со всем, что хранит Blend-"
"ed. Ссылка действует {days} дн. и только для вас."

#. Translators: {name} is the person whose data was exported.
msgid "{name}'s data is ready to download"
msgstr "Данные пользователя {name} готовы к скачиванию"

#. Translators: {name} is the person whose data was exported; {days} how many
#. days the link works.
msgid ""
"{name}'s data is ready: one zip file of everything Blend-ed keeps. The link "
"works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Данные пользователя {name} готовы: один zip-файл со всем, что хранит Blend-"
"ed. Ссылка действует {days} дн. и только для вас."

msgid "Download the file"
msgstr "Скачать файл"

msgid "Your full export is ready to download"
msgstr "Ваш полный экспорт готов к скачиванию"

#. Translators: {days} is how many days the download link works.
msgid ""
"Your full export is ready: one zip file of your platform's records. The link"
" works for {days} days, and only for you."
msgstr ""
"Ваш полный экспорт готов: один zip-файл с записями вашей платформы. Ссылка "
"действует {days} дн. и только для вас."

#. Translators: {report} is the report's name; {start} and {end} are dates
#. (YYYY-MM-DD).
msgid "The {report} report for {start} to {end} is ready to download."
msgstr "Отчёт «{report}» за период с {start} по {end} готов к скачиванию."

#. Translators: {end} is the week's last day ("19 November 2026"); the others
#. are counts.
msgid ""
"Week to {end}. Seats in use: {assigned} of {funded}. New seats: {new_seats}."
" Results recorded: {results}. Certificates earned: {certificates}."
msgstr ""
"Неделя по {end}. Используется мест: {assigned} из {funded}. Новых мест: "
"{new_seats}. Записано результатов: {results}. Получено сертификатов: "
"{certificates}."

#. Translators: {tenant} is the company's name.
msgid "{tenant}: your week in learning"
msgstr "{tenant}: ваша неделя обучения"

#. Translators: {name} is the instructor's name; {title} is the session's
#. name.
msgid "{name} is away for {title}"
msgstr "{name} отсутствует во время {title}"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name, {when} the date's start and
#. {name} the instructor's name.
msgid ""
"{title} on {when} falls in {name}'s time off. They are still its instructor "
"until you change it."
msgstr ""
"{title} {when} попадает на нерабочее время {name}. Этот человек остаётся "
"преподавателем, пока вы не измените назначение."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; the instructor's name is not
#. known.
msgid "An instructor is away for {title}"
msgstr "Преподаватель отсутствует во время {title}"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name and {when} the date's start; the
#. instructor's name is not
#. known.
msgid ""
"{title} on {when} falls in the instructor's time off. They are still its "
"instructor until you change it."
msgstr ""
"{title} ({when}) приходится на нерабочее время преподавателя. Преподаватель "
"остаётся назначенным, пока вы это не измените."

msgid "{name}, you earned a Session certificate!"
msgstr "{name}, вы получили сертификат занятия!"

#. Translators: {part} is the date's number within the session; {title} is the
#. session's name.
msgid "Part {part} of {title}"
msgstr "Часть {part}: {title}"

#. Translators: {by} is who moved the date; {title} the date's name; {when}
#. the new date and time, {was}
#. the old one.
msgid "{by} moved {title} to {when} (it was {was})."
msgstr "{by} перенёс(ла) {title} на {when} (было {was})."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("{title} was moved to …"). {when} is the new date and
#. time, {was} the old one.
msgid "moved {title} to {when} (it was {was})."
msgstr "перенёс(ла) {title} на {when} (было {was})."

msgid "{title} moved"
msgstr "{title}: перенесено"

#. Translators: {by} is who cancelled the date; {title} the date's name; {was}
#. the date and time it had.
msgid "{by} cancelled {title}, {was}."
msgstr "{by} отменил(а) {title}, {was}."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("{title}, {was}, was cancelled."). {was} is the date and
#. time it had.
msgid "cancelled {title}, {was}."
msgstr "отменил(а) {title}, {was}."

msgid "{title} cancelled"
msgstr "{title}: отменено"

#. Translators: {by} is who added the instructor; {title} the date's name;
#. {when} its date and time.
msgid "{by} added you to {title}, {when}."
msgstr "{by} добавил(а) вас на {title}, {when}."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a
#. complete sentence ("You were added to {title}, {when}."). {when} is the
#. date and time.
msgid "added you to {title}, {when}."
msgstr "добавил(а) вас на {title}, {when}."

msgid "You're teaching {title}"
msgstr "Вы ведёте {title}"

#. Translators: {by} is who changed the date's instructors; {title} the date's
#. name; {was} its date and time.
msgid "{by} changed its instructors; {title} on {was} is not yours any more."
msgstr ""
"{by} изменил(а) состав преподавателей; {title} {was} больше не ваше занятие."

#. Translators: the whole message when no one is named; English leaves out who
#. did it. Write it as a complete
#. sentence ("Its instructors changed; …"). {was} is the date and time.
msgid "changed its instructors; {title} on {was} is not yours any more."
msgstr ""
"изменил(а) состав преподавателей; {title} {was} больше не ваше занятие."

msgid "You're no longer teaching {title}"
msgstr "Вы больше не ведёте {title}"

msgid "Confirm attendance for {title}"
msgstr "Подтвердите посещаемость: {title}"

msgid "{title} has ended. Confirm who attended."
msgstr "{title} завершено. Подтвердите, кто присутствовал."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {minutes} how many minutes
#. until it starts. English keeps
#. "minutes" even for 1.
msgid "{title} starts in {minutes} minutes"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {minutes} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{title} начнётся через {minutes} мин."
msgstr[1] "{title} начнётся через {minutes} мин."
msgstr[2] "{title} начнётся через {minutes} мин."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {when} its start date and time.
msgid "{title} starts at {when}."
msgstr "{title} начинается {when}."

msgid "Tomorrow: {count} session"
msgid_plural "Tomorrow: {count} sessions"
msgstr[0] "Завтра занятий: {count}"
msgstr[1] "Завтра занятий: {count}"
msgstr[2] "Завтра занятий: {count}"

msgid "{count} new submission to review"
msgid_plural "{count} new submissions to review"
msgstr[0] "Новых работ на проверку: {count}"
msgstr[1] "Новых работ на проверку: {count}"
msgstr[2] "Новых работ на проверку: {count}"

#. Translators: {batch} is the batch's name; {count} how many submissions wait
#. for a grade.
msgid "{batch}: {count} submission waiting for a grade."
msgid_plural "{batch}: {count} submissions waiting for a grade."
msgstr[0] "{batch}: работ, ожидающих оценки: {count}."
msgstr[1] "{batch}: работ, ожидающих оценки: {count}."
msgstr[2] "{batch}: работ, ожидающих оценки: {count}."

msgid "Weekly review due for {batches}"
msgstr "Пора провести еженедельный обзор: {batches}"

msgid "below the passing score"
msgstr "ниже проходного балла"

msgid "not active for 14 days"
msgstr "неактивен 14 дней"

msgid "not active for 7 days"
msgstr "неактивен 7 дней"

msgid "behind on progress"
msgstr "отстаёт по прогрессу"

msgid "{name} needs help"
msgstr "{name} нужна помощь"

#. Translators: {name} is the learner's name, {batch} the batch's and {why}
#. the reasons,
#. comma-separated.
msgid "{name} in {batch}: {why}."
msgstr "{name} в {batch}: {why}."

msgid "{title}: your date has moved"
msgstr "{title}: ваша дата перенесена"

msgid "Your date of {title} now starts at {when}."
msgstr "Ваша дата «{title}» теперь начинается {when}."

msgid "{title}: your date is cancelled"
msgstr "{title}: ваша дата отменена"

msgid ""
"The date of {title} you had a place on is cancelled. You can book another "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Дата занятия «{title}», на которую у вас было место, отменена. Вы можете "
"забронировать другую дату."

msgid "{title}: you have a place"
msgstr "{title}: у вас есть место"

msgid "A place freed on {title} and you are booked for {when}."
msgstr "Освободилось место на {title}, и вы записаны на {when}."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {count} how many hours until it
#. starts.
msgid "{title} starts in {count} hour"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {count} hours"
msgstr[0] "{title} начнётся через {count} ч."
msgstr[1] "{title} начнётся через {count} ч."
msgstr[2] "{title} начнётся через {count} ч."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name.
msgid "{title} starts in 1 hour"
msgstr "{title} начнётся через 1 час"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name.
msgid "{title} starts in a few minutes"
msgstr "{title} начнётся через несколько минут"

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {count} how many minutes until
#. it starts (5 or more).
msgid "{title} starts in {count} minute"
msgid_plural "{title} starts in {count} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{title} начнётся через {count} мин."
msgstr[1] "{title} начнётся через {count} мин."
msgstr[2] "{title} начнётся через {count} мин."

#. Translators: {title} is the session's name; {when} is its start date and
#. time.
msgid "Your booked date of {title} starts at {when}."
msgstr "Забронированная вами дата «{title}» начинается {when}."

#. Translators: {name} is who raised it, {type} the ticket's type code (issue,
#. bug, feature, other) and {title}
#. its title.
msgid "{name} raised a new {type} ticket: {title}"
msgstr "{name} создал(а) новое обращение типа «{type}»: {title}"

msgid "New support ticket"
msgstr "Новое обращение в поддержку"

msgid "Your support update"
msgstr "Новости по вашему обращению"

msgid "Your ticket {title} has been closed."
msgstr "Ваше обращение {title} закрыто."

msgid "Your ticket {title} has been reopened."
msgstr "Ваше обращение {title} открыто повторно."

msgid "Ticket assigned to you"
msgstr "Вам назначено обращение"

msgid "You have been assigned the ticket {title}."
msgstr "Вам назначено обращение {title}."

#. Translators: {name} is who commented, {title} the ticket's title and
#. {comment} their words.
msgid "{name} commented on your ticket {title}: {comment}"
msgstr "{name} прокомментировал(а) ваше обращение {title}: {comment}"

msgid "New comment on your ticket"
msgstr "Новый комментарий к вашему обращению"
